  "ALL_TEXT": "116 EXT. MINISTER'S HOUSE - NIGHT \nFestivities are galore, with the house lit up, and a welcome \nboard saying it is the FOREST Minister's GRANDSON's birthday. \nVEDA, SULOCHANA, GOVARDHAN and the BUM have their heads \ncovered with black cloth. The LEAD GOON, sitting in the van, \ncalls the FOREST MINISTER. \nGOVARDHAN \nAnna nalugurini thesukocham pacha \nbriefcase okati undhi \nFOREST MINISTER (O.S.) \nRey rey pacha briefcase kadu errupu \nbriefcase, evarini \nthesukuvocharu... Naluguru evvaru \nra, muggure kadhaa \nLEAD GOON \nKani naluguru unnaaru anna \nFOREST MINISTER (O.S.) \nRey dhedhdheemag chepinna pani \neppudaina sarigga chesaaru ra? \nLEAD GOON \nAnna ila tidhethe velpotha \nFOREST MINISTER (O.S.) \nSare agorinchavule..baba gaadini \nkattesina room ki tesukuni randi. \nLEAD GOON \nSare anna. \nThe LEAD GOON pulls out a piece of paper. \nLEAD GOON \nAttendance thesukunta paru pilichi \nnapudu present ani cheya ethandi \nHe digs into his pocket, and slowly puts on spectacles, with \none side of the frame broken. \nLEAD GOON \nVEDA \nPresent \nVEDA \nLEAD GOON \nPresent enti ra present enti?? \nPresent sir anali \nVEDA \nPresent sir \nGOVARDHAN \nOrder adhe kadu \nLEAD GOON \nEnti? \nGOVARDHAN \nAlphabetical order adhikaadhu \nVEDA and SULOCHANA sigh \nLEAD GOON \nAnte? \nABC Vocha? \nThe LEAD GOON nods \nGOVARDHAN \nLEAD GOON \nA b c d e f g \nThe LEAD GOON realizes he is being bullied \nLEAD GOON \nedhi emmana school aa ra abcd lu \nchepadaaniki \nGOVARDHAN \nMari edhi emmana school aa \nattendance tesukovadaniki? \nThe LEAD GOON hits GOVARDHAN with a stick \nGOVARDHAN \naaa rakshashuda!! \nLEAD GOON \n(to the BUM) \nAnna correct gaane cheppaaru list \nlo mugguru ae unnaaru..nuvvu evaru \nra? \nThe LEAD GOON pulls off the black cloth from the BUM's head. \nThe BUM stares at him. The LEAD GOON shoos away the reluctant \nBUM, who looks into the vehicle to take back his briefcase. \nThe LEAD GOON sees the BUM looking for his briefcase. \nLE